{
  "_how_to_edit": [
    "Each entry is one employer whose public careers feed is read every morning.",
    "name    - shown on the page.",
    "group   - labs | thinktank | government | industry | academia.",
    "focus   - 'ai' if the whole organisation works on AI (every economics, policy or research role is kept);",
    "          'general' if not (the advert itself must be about AI, technology or digital markets).",
    "ats     - which careers system the employer uses: greenhouse | ashby | lever | workable | recruitee | smartrecruiters | workday | rss.",
    "token   - the employer's name in that system, i.e. the last part of its careers address,",
    "          e.g. job-boards.greenhouse.io/anthropic -> anthropic, jobs.ashbyhq.com/openai -> openai.",
    "careers - the page students can browse themselves.",
    "Add \"disabled\": true to switch an employer off without deleting it."
  ],
